{"overview":"As Alice and Cora Munro attempt to find their father, a British officer in the French and Indian War, they are set upon by French soldiers and their cohorts, Huron tribesmen led by the evil Magua. Fighting to rescue the women are Chingachgook and his son Uncas, the last of the Mohican tribe, and their white ally, the frontiersman Natty Bumppo, known as Hawkeye.","tagline":"The story of a prince without a kingdom","cast":[{"n":"Wallace Beery","c":"Magua","p":"/a26DU6lG8YPAr9QgSOCDuZWAI2l.jpg","q":"Q322179"},{"n":"Barbara Bedford","c":"Cora Munro","p":"/kjMpv29yRVsN9meWRtfQMExg9TQ.jpg","q":"Q2883905"},{"n":"Alan Roscoe","c":"Uncas","p":"/r7dI0JkuISCWV7rVbPqWgDMMEtB.jpg","q":"Q2830579"},{"n":"Lillian Hall","c":"Alice Munro","p":"/AemZ31xWsLCBNPdygCC4JsIFLFN.jpg","q":"Q83389621"},{"n":"Henry Woodward","c":"Maj. Heyward","p":"/8yNOnGxTupUQnfEVflOwXizP2fI.jpg","q":null},{"n":"James Gordon","c":"Col. Munro","p":"/ngVF1uIAGqnZULYGu43OzRV6VfR.jpg","q":"Q3161107"},{"n":"George Hackathorne","c":"Capt. Randolph","p":"/asTjA8gIhfCcVNVvLPwiVcqTnJG.jpg","q":"Q5540128"},{"n":"Nelson McDowell","c":"David Gamut - a Preacher","p":"/c9WodDYcxUL0P5X1zq1DVgJXogG.jpg","q":"Q6990645"},{"n":"Harry Lorraine","c":"Hawkeye - Scout","p":null,"q":"Q5670713"},{"n":"Theodore Lorch","c":"Chingachgook","p":"/yKsFtQczv5UMDpbPJtGa7qWONGy.jpg","q":"Q7781895"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Last_of_the_Mohicans_(1920_American_film)","qid":"Q444242","rel":{"CZ":{"d":"2023-10-28","c":"12+"},"SU":{"d":"1923-01-01"},"US":{"d":"1920-11-21","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/8ZfVinPGln97EDvvA3Kss8EMRF5.jpg","/amSXCwseciz7Wb7zrzHow3oLDdW.jpg"]}